            "text": "<p><em>We stand behind every product we craft, with our industry best warranty for quality and workmanship. </em><em><strong><br/><br/></strong></em></p><p>*US claims only. For claims in Canada, please visit <a href=\"https://skre.ca/\"><strong>www.skre.ca</strong></a><strong><br/><br/></strong></p><p><strong>Warranty stipulations:</strong></p><ul><li>Valid only if the gear is used for consumer use</li><li>Coverage indefinite<br/><br/></li></ul><p><strong>Our Warranty covers:</strong></p><ul><li>All manufacturer's defects, including:Material defectsButtons and bucklesZippers and zipper housingSeamsStitchingPeelingShrinkingDelimitationVelcro</li><li>Craftsmanship defects</li><li>Accessory defects<br/><br/></li></ul><p><strong>Our Warranty does not cover:</strong></p><ul><li>Damage from normal wear and tear</li><li>Branded apparel items (t-shirts, hoodies, etc.)</li><li>Socks or underwear (boxers)</li></ul><p><a href=\"https://skregear.com/apps/redo/returns-portal#/login\"><br/><br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">To start a warranty claim, click here</span></a></p>",
